WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,800
Brothers, wait

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,380
Let’s go to my brother’s house for dinner tonight

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,820
Your sister-in-law has talked about you several times

4
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,940
Today is another great day for you to be commended

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:13,080
Let's have a drink together

6
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,920
Brother Gao, I accept your sister-in-law’s wishes.

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,760
Thank you sister-in-law for me too

8
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,900
But it’s really not possible today

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,220
What's up? There's something going on in the village.

10
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:26,650
There are still some things waiting for me to go back in the village

11
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:35,290
Besides, I've been out for two days. It's time to go back. I understand.

12
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:38,730
Are you in a hurry to go back to see your unmarried little wife?

13
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:45,500
Okay, okay, I won’t keep you

14
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,660
Waiting for your wedding reception

15
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:49,380
I will definitely take people there to have fun

16
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,460
Definitely welcome

17
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,340
Brother Gao, please hurry back and get busy.
